{"id":1020801,"chapter_id":1020801,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"灰烬战役已经过去半年，费沙和平盛典落幕，狄斯跟远邦联盟的争端暂告一段落。危险的“戾刃”兵器也逐渐回归掌控。\n\n这以后，又过去了很久，茉莉醒了。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"但随之而来的并不是什么好消息。","style":14,"background":10000,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"入夜116年3月3日\n班彦四院特别收容科","style":9,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"%u","content":"再次封存是什么意思？！","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"%u","content":"我看过EDGE报告， LINK能有效调和她的狂厄紊乱。数据一度很稳定，她该好起来的，班彦说过她很快就能回来。才几天过去，怎么又换了说法？","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"医生","content":"冷静，局长。我院早改进了疗法，在人道主义测评中取得很高的分数，更不会在您关心的禁闭者身上做什么违规操作。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"医生","content":"LINK技术是成功的，那位名叫茉莉的女人确实已经苏醒，问题嘛……也正出在她苏醒后。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"他拿起厚厚一叠报告，递来的途中又停了下来，迟疑片刻，说：","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"医生","content":"……这么说也不太有说服力，还请跟我来吧。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"班彦四院深处没那么陌生，它的安防监控等级可比肩MBCC，令人窒息。因为这里关押研究的同样是被视为“危险”“疯子”的“病人”。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801011,"trial_step":11},{"step":11,"content":"一路深入，枷锁逐渐躁动，另一头禁闭者的癫狂正在感染你，迫使你加快步伐。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801012,"trial_step":12},{"step":12,"content":"但在抵达前，你先被一声尖锐的怒吼击中了。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801013,"trial_step":13},{"step":13,"content":"【闪屏】","style":18,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801014,"trial_step":14},{"step":14,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"别过来！滚开！！","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801015,"trial_step":15},{"step":15,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"刀呢？我的刀呢？！还回来，把我的东西还回来！！","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801016,"trial_step":16},{"step":16,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"啊啊啊啊——！！","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801017,"trial_step":17},{"step":17,"content":"随即是令人揪心的一幕。隔着高防护单向玻璃，你看见茉莉长发凌乱，神情狰狞，在冷灰色的混凝土隔离间中，她像暴怒的猎豹般伏地弓背，咆哮着，更显瘦骨嶙峋。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801018,"trial_step":18},{"step":18,"content":"几个壮实护工将手无寸铁的她逼到死角，手上拿着针剂药品治疗器械，上前半步就被喝退几米，显然已经拉锯了很久。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801019,"trial_step":19},{"step":19,"speaker":"医生","content":"情况就是这样，她的精神状态很糟，需要专业的药物治疗、精神干预。但如你所见，我们没有能力让她接受任何治疗。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801021,"trial_step":21},{"step":20,"speaker":"医生","content":"这么下去，在出现更大的意外前，将她再度封存可能是唯一的办法。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801022,"trial_step":22},{"step":21,"content":"他话没说完，一个护工被甩了过来，猛砸在你身前的单向玻璃上，几个护士惊叫着哭出声。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801023,"trial_step":23},{"step":22,"speaker":"护士","content":"……镇定剂，快，镇定剂！","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801024,"trial_step":24},{"step":23,"options":["等等！"],"style":6,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801025,"trial_step":25,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"等等！","goto":26}]},{"step":24,"content":"你按住她颤抖的手，向前一步。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801026,"trial_step":26},{"step":25,"speaker":"%u","content":"……让我试试，MBCC更了解禁闭者，茉莉沉睡前也跟我有过交流……让我试试吧。","style":2,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801027,"trial_step":27},{"step":26,"content":"你向前，一直看着隔离墙另一侧。茉莉还维持着攻击姿势，眦目怒视着被她击飞的护工，也正看向你所在的方向。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801029,"trial_step":29},{"step":27,"content":"隔着单向玻璃，你终于对上她遍布血丝的眼睛。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801030,"trial_step":30},{"step":28,"content":"她顿了顿。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801031,"trial_step":31},{"step":29,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"…………？！","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801032,"trial_step":32},{"step":30,"content":"是累了？察觉护工们脸色微变？或是混乱中才感应到枷锁在附近？还是……隔着看不见的墙她竟也看见了你？","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801033,"trial_step":33},{"step":31,"content":"她眼中的怒意动摇了，竟浮现几分迷茫。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801034,"trial_step":34},{"step":32,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……大人？","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801035,"trial_step":35},{"step":33,"options":["回应茉莉"],"style":6,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801036,"trial_step":36,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"回应茉莉","goto":37}]},{"step":34,"content":"你缓慢向前，控制枷锁微微发热，想借那点稀薄的温度缓和她的怒火。警报声渐歇，医护们迟疑着、最终小心打开那扇门。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801037,"trial_step":37},{"step":35,"content":"你们相隔不远，中间也再没了阻碍，茉莉看见你了。她一阵恍惚，像噩梦乍醒，又像在怀疑自己的眼睛。终于，在你轻唤她名字时，她的身体先有了反应。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801038,"trial_step":38},{"step":36,"content":"摇晃着，跌撞着，脚步绵软无力，却又急切地小步奔向你。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801039,"trial_step":39},{"step":37,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……我在做梦吗？大人，真的是你吗，我——","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801040,"trial_step":40},{"step":38,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"！","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801041,"trial_step":41},{"step":39,"content":"——又在几步之外骤然刹住。她的脸色一转阴郁。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801042,"trial_step":42},{"step":40,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……为什么……你身上有……他们的味道……","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801043,"trial_step":43},{"step":41,"speaker":"%u","content":"！","style":2,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801044,"trial_step":44},{"step":42,"content":"你当即知道她在说什么。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801045,"trial_step":45},{"step":43,"content":"【闪过局长残锋团军装】","style":18,"background":2453,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801047,"trial_step":47},{"step":44,"content":"战场的味道？还是残锋团的痕迹？时隔好几个月，任何能刺激她的气味本不可能还有残留，但茉莉就是捕捉到了。","style":3,"background":2453,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801048,"trial_step":48},{"step":45,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"你到他们那边了吗……你也去当狄斯的刀了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801049,"trial_step":49},{"step":46,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"那你也去死吧！！！","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801050,"trial_step":50},{"step":47,"speaker":"医生","content":"局长，枷锁！！","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801051,"trial_step":51},{"step":48,"options":["释放枷锁，保护自己","克制，不能刺激茉莉"],"style":6,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801052,"trial_step":52,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"释放枷锁，保护自己","goto":53},{"text":"克制，不能刺激茉莉","goto":58}]},{"step":49,"content":"她向你冲来，你本能放出枷锁，尖刺穿透她的身体打断动作，也彻底激怒了她。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801053,"trial_step":53},{"step":50,"content":"女人凄厉地嘶吼，借惯性撞倒你，把你压在地上，手动不了就张口，她一口咬上你侧颈，隔着制服几乎啃下血肉。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801054,"trial_step":54},{"step":51,"content":"你满心的悲伤愧疚瞬间被最原始的恐惧取代，身体像虎口之羊般抽动，直到人群一拥而上，强效镇静剂结实扎进茉莉的脖颈。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801055,"trial_step":55},{"step":52,"content":"茉莉倒下了，从你身上被拖开，你的血将她嘴唇染成鲜红夸张的笑。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801056,"trial_step":56},{"step":53,"content":"只差一点点，刚才她本可以一口咬断你的喉咙。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801057,"trial_step":57,"next":[63]},{"step":54,"content":"你压过本能不用枷锁压制“威胁”，于是她冲来把你扑倒在地，干瘦的十指箍紧你脖子，任医护怎么拉扯都分不开。尖叫着，像在怒斥你，又像在质问索求什么。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801059,"trial_step":59},{"step":55,"content":"最后，在你晕厥前，一支强效镇静剂结实扎进她脖颈。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801060,"trial_step":60},{"step":56,"content":"茉莉倒下了，伏在你胸前，染红了的双眼始终没有合上。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801061,"trial_step":61},{"step":57,"content":"就这么瞪着你，满眼恨意浸湿在泪中。","style":3,"background":2190,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801062,"trial_step":62},{"step":58,"content":"【切黑屏】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801063,"trial_step":63},{"step":59,"content":"【S-105精神检查报告】\nLINK修复了S-105被狂厄破坏的精神，经四院评估，稳定度达到可唤醒标准。但唤醒后，她个人性格和行为让情况快速恶化。\n长期的噩梦和绝食让她的精神状况变得极不稳定，医护无法近身，常规的镇定干预根本无从展开，也没有任何手段能“说服”狂厄级禁闭者配合治疗。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801064,"trial_step":64},{"step":60,"content":"……医师推测她触发了某种防御机制，将无法承受的创伤跟过去的记忆认知重组整合，导致情绪感知错位。她拒绝面对现实，也无法信任外界，狂厄更放大了她的攻击倾向和实际破坏力……\n症状过于复杂，操作困难，无法制定方案，而S-105的精神状态随着时间流逝将进一步恶化。\n\n综合考虑后，我院强烈建议对S-105重新启用冻眠。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801065,"trial_step":65},{"step":61,"content":"戾刃压制技术已经基本完善，我院无法再以“协助研究”为由保护她不受上级处置。袭击MBCC局长一事已经引来多方关注，如果不重新封存，未来还会有很大概率引发更严重的安全危机。到那时……\n\n……等待她的可能只有被人道销毁的结局。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801066,"trial_step":66},{"step":62,"content":"那天过后，连续好几晚，你都做着模糊不清的噩梦。直到申请获批，确定将茉莉转调MBCC后才勉强结束。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801067,"trial_step":67},{"step":63,"content":"你为这件事做了很多努力，充分排除所有可能的异邦外交风险，争取FAC和班彦医学院相关部门的支持，设计了一系列保密规则，确保没有消息泄露、不造成任何公众影响。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801068,"trial_step":68},{"step":64,"content":"虽然四院称能快速批准都是因为“EDGE里有人给您撑腰”，但他们前后给予的恳切帮助都不是假的。他们很担忧，你感谢这份心意。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801069,"trial_step":69},{"step":65,"content":"……你大概的确在做蠢事。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801070,"trial_step":70},{"step":66,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1020800},{"step":67,"content":"灯开了，茉莉没有抬头，没有嘶吼也没有再暴起攻击。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1020800},{"step":68,"content":"她手脚都被上了特制的反狂厄镣铐，桎梏太久，人已经放弃挣扎，只在你进门时又向后缩了一寸，缩进狭小冰冷的椅间。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1020800},{"step":69,"content":"审查室是关押她的牢房，而她进一步把自己锁进更狭小的笼子，憎恶着你的靠近。另一头，在监视器后、审查室外，你的下属们也在全程戒备。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1020800},{"step":70,"content":"班彦四院的袭击事件早已传开，没人敢再让你涉险。在“多人审查”和“行动限制”之间，你最终选择了后者，心想对她的刺激也许能小一点。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1020800},{"step":71,"content":"——当然，这些考量对她来说毫无意义。乱发阴影下，茉莉双眼阴鸷地锁定你，隐隐泛着红光，这样的重逢让人窒息。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1020803},{"step":72,"content":"沉默半晌后，你起身离开“安全范围”的座椅向茉莉靠近，又在她退缩前停下，指了指她镣铐下有些发红的手腕。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1020803},{"step":73,"options":["疼吗？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801080,"trial_step":80,"course":3,"drawing":1020803,"choices":[{"text":"疼吗？","goto":81}]},{"step":74,"speaker":"%u","content":"难受的话，我把它取下来。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1020803},{"step":75,"speaker":"%u","content":"这里只有我们两个，没事的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1020803},{"step":76,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1020800},{"step":77,"content":"见她没有拒绝，你便又上前一步，到茉莉身边半跪下来，动手解她捆得最紧的镣铐。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1020800},{"step":78,"content":"她看着你，好一会儿，低头凑近，鼻子嗅了嗅，终于露出点笑容。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1020802},{"step":79,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……您洗澡了……多了好几种不一样的香气……呵呵……","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1020802},{"step":80,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"想盖住那股<color=#fb9259>臭味</color>吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1020802},{"step":81,"content":"你的手顿了顿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1020802},{"step":82,"content":"看来她的确平静很多，找回了机警狡黠，还有余裕试探、挑拨你、刺痛你，像狐狸玩弄被发现的捕兽夹，分寸把握得刚刚好。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1020802},{"step":83,"content":"你没回答，继续动手。咔哒——第一个镣铐解开了。她猛抽回手，避开任何你可能的触碰。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1020800},{"step":84,"content":"你不强求，身子向后退了些，垂下目光，仍保持屈膝半跪的姿势。你知道她低头就能看见你，一高一低间，你成了被审视的人。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1020800},{"step":85,"speaker":"%u","content":"我的确上了战场。我见过战争了，茉莉。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1020800},{"step":86,"speaker":"%u","content":"它杀戮，破坏，践踏人之所以为人的一切，无论敌我。我为保护自己爱的人投身其中，可短短几天，我的心里就只剩仇恨，恨人，也被人憎恨。流血，也让别人流血。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1020800},{"step":87,"speaker":"%u","content":"想找到真正的信念不容易，我努力去做了。但还有很多牺牲无法避免，很多错误无法挽回，有些阴影终生不能忘记。你说的对，只要经历一次，很多事就再回不到从前。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1020800},{"step":88,"speaker":"%u","content":"但我希望你不被禁锢在最残酷的地方。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1020800},{"step":89,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1020803},{"step":90,"content":"你抬头，正对上她的目光。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1020803},{"step":91,"speaker":"%u","content":"我不奢求你的原谅，我只希望你好好活着。狂厄也好，战争也好，已经有一些治疗办法能减缓你的痛苦，不再继续恶化。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1020803},{"step":92,"speaker":"%u","content":"如果你无法忍受狄斯人的接触，那我去找你的朋友、你能信任的人们，送你回远邦也可以，会有善良的人关心照顾你。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1020803},{"step":93,"speaker":"%u","content":"我没资格祝你幸福，但狄斯已经给了你太多的痛苦，别再被我们禁锢、别回那个冰冷的实验室，别……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1020803},{"step":94,"content":"【闪回茉莉被抬走的CG】","style":18,"background":4501,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1020803},{"step":95,"speaker":"%u","content":"……别让你恨的人再一次摧毁你，你好不容易从战争中活下来，不该再走向那样的结局。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1020803},{"step":96,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"………………","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1020802},{"step":97,"content":"茉莉没回应你任何一项提案，只听你说着，渐渐地她不再退缩，双眼不带虚饰地看着你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1020804},{"step":98,"content":"就这么看着你，看着，看着，慢慢地她抬手，向你的脸颊靠近，然后——","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1020804},{"step":99,"speaker":"%u","content":"……！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1020804},{"step":100,"content":"你被她掐住脖子，强忍着震惊，不出声也不挣扎，手背在身后给监视镜头打手势稳住下属——你要冷静，看着她的眼睛，别中断对话，你知道现在绝不能移开目光。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1020804},{"step":101,"content":"一会儿，茉莉露出笑容，她赞赏你的勇敢，可惜肌肉僵硬脉搏加速全都传到她掌心。她咯咯笑起来，掐你的手这时才卸了所有狠劲儿，软软抚摸你被捏红的咽喉。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1020802},{"step":102,"content":"在你唱了那么久的独角戏后，茉莉终于开口说话了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1020802},{"step":103,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"呵……说那么多茉莉听不懂的话做什么？大人啊……您明明就是在<color=#fb9259>怕</color>我嘛。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1020802},{"step":104,"content":"她指尖向上，沿下颌抚过你脸颊，冰凉地描画你的表情，一副笑嘻嘻的模样。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1020802},{"step":105,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"治疗？什么是治疗？把茉莉捆起来、扎针、喂药？直到她再喊不出声、闹不起事？要是我太笨了学不乖，就干脆再泡水里睡觉，不准醒来？","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1020802},{"step":106,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"嘻，我知道的，那些穿白大褂的人就这么想，他们看我的眼神都那样。怕我，烦我，又不得不来见我。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1020802},{"step":107,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"呵呵……狄斯人都这样，跟战场上拿刀迎我的家伙们一样……您也一样。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1020803},{"step":108,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"<i>“真够麻烦的，明明是<color=#fb9259>敌人</color>，她怎么还不去死啊？”</i>","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1020802},{"step":109,"content":"她表演了起来，笑容里尽是赤裸裸的讥讽和嫌恶。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1020802},{"step":110,"options":["……别死，茉莉"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801118,"trial_step":118,"course":3,"drawing":1020802,"choices":[{"text":"……别死，茉莉","goto":119}]},{"step":111,"speaker":"%u","content":"战争已经结束了，这里不是战场，也没有杀人的利刃，我不是你的敌人。我希望你好好活着。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1020802},{"step":112,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"不是吗？那就怪了……您更不是我的亲人呀！","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1020802},{"step":113,"content":"她靠得更近了，双手细细描摹你的脸，笑着辨认你的模样，像捧起战场滚落的头颅。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1020804},{"step":114,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"不是敌人，也不是亲人……那您算我的什么人？为什么抓着我不放？","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1020804},{"step":115,"speaker":"%u","content":"你的痛苦也同样撕裂我，我没法放手。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1020804},{"step":116,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"别说的你很了解我一样！","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":21,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1020804},{"step":117,"content":"她一把推开你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1020803},{"step":118,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"我从哪儿来，走过哪里，看见的听到的闻过的是什么样，你能知道多少？凭什么由你决定我该怎么过？","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1020803},{"step":119,"content":"旋即脸色又一变，凑近你耳边狡黠吹息。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1020802},{"step":120,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"不然……您来实现我的愿望？","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1020802},{"step":121,"content":"你知道她说的“愿望”是什么。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1020802},{"step":122,"content":"【回忆1秒，万国会闭幕式，暴走染血的茉莉两边是黑色的FAC】","style":18,"background":2398,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1020802},{"step":123,"content":"于是她也读懂了你紧绷的沉默回应。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1020801},{"step":124,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……不愿意吧？我早看出来了，那还白费什么力气。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1020801},{"step":125,"content":"她仰身展了个懒腰。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1020802},{"step":126,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"唉……对不起啊，大人，其实我都懂，您本就是那边的人。看着我会感到疼，靠近我会觉得怕。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_108"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1020802},{"step":127,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"要不是我坏，学了西比拉那套，靠近您来卖惨，您本不用为我费这么多心。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1020802},{"step":128,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"就因为大人是大好人，才见不得我可怜。唉……放过自己，也放过茉莉吧，不用勉强自己来爱我。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_110"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1020802},{"step":129,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"大人的爱太宽厚了，您爱的太多太多，舍不掉茉莉也舍不掉茉莉的敌人……那还是端走吧。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_111"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1020802},{"step":130,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"这样的爱，茉莉不需要。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1020801},{"step":131,"speaker":"%u","content":"………………","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1020801},{"step":132,"content":"她又要使劲，想推开你，但这次没成功。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801141,"trial_step":141,"drawing":1020801},{"step":133,"content":"茉莉瘦削的手被你抓住，被紧紧握着不松开。她脸色先是惊讶，再变得厌恶、恼怒，她开始挣扎，但你仍不放手。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801142,"trial_step":142,"drawing":1020803},{"step":134,"content":"你知道自己在做蠢事。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801143,"trial_step":143,"drawing":1020803},{"step":135,"speaker":"医生","content":"不管您是出于善心、责任、或是愧疚，还是因为别的什么心理想帮助她……别抱太大期望。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801144,"trial_step":144},{"step":136,"speaker":"医生","content":"这世上存在无法治愈的创伤，有些人生不容介入。茉莉的过去太沉重了，背负她比您想象的更加困难，为避免出现更严重的后果，我会始终劝您及时止损。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801145,"trial_step":145},{"step":137,"speaker":"医生","content":"否则，您迟早会后悔的。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801146,"trial_step":146},{"step":138,"content":"说这话时他神色凝重，你明白他不只在说“茉莉”，在医生眼里你也快成了“病人”。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801147,"trial_step":147},{"step":139,"content":"但决心已定，你紧紧握着茉莉的手。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801148,"trial_step":148,"drawing":1020803},{"step":140,"speaker":"%u","content":"……我知道你看不上，恨我也没关系，但我不能放你走。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801149,"trial_step":149,"drawing":1020803},{"step":141,"speaker":"%u","content":"你也欠了我不少东西。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801150,"trial_step":150,"drawing":1020803},{"step":142,"options":["“庆典”前的约定，还记得吗？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801151,"trial_step":151,"course":3,"drawing":1020803,"choices":[{"text":"“庆典”前的约定，还记得吗？","goto":152}]},{"step":143,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801152,"trial_step":152,"drawing":1020804},{"step":144,"content":"【闪回】趴腿CG","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801153,"trial_step":153,"drawing":1020804},{"step":145,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"带我去庆典吧，大人，结束后我会回来的，按约定回到您身边。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_133"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":4528,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801154,"trial_step":154},{"step":146,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"等闭幕式结束……我愿意追随您去任何地方。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_134"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":4528,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801155,"trial_step":155},{"step":147,"content":"【回审查室】","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801156,"trial_step":156,"drawing":1020804},{"step":148,"speaker":"%u","content":"托MBCC的福，你已经去过“庆典”了，闭幕式结束了，现在，兑现你说过的话吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801157,"trial_step":157,"drawing":1020804},{"step":149,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……狡猾的家伙，臭狐狸……你怎么敢——","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_137"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801158,"trial_step":158,"drawing":1020800},{"step":150,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"那都是骗你的！费沙的家伙教我那么做，说你有办法带我去闭幕式，说、说你人蠢心又软，我才盯上你，靠近你讨好你……那些根本不算约定！我说谎了！","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801159,"trial_step":159,"drawing":1020800},{"step":151,"content":"她用力推你，打你，指甲在你身上划出一道道血痕。但你死抓着不放手。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801160,"trial_step":160,"drawing":1020800},{"step":152,"options":["无所谓"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801161,"trial_step":161,"course":3,"drawing":1020800,"choices":[{"text":"无所谓","goto":162}]},{"step":153,"speaker":"%u","content":"说过的话只要能兑现，就不是谎言。我相信茉莉很“真诚”。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801162,"trial_step":162,"drawing":1020801},{"step":154,"speaker":"%u","content":"上次你毁约只是因为打仗，你推说“打仗时美好的约定都容易破灭”。那现在战争结束了，你那对刀也能被控制了，时机刚刚好，来吧茉莉。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801163,"trial_step":163,"drawing":1020801},{"step":155,"speaker":"%u","content":"一件一件来，我全记得。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801164,"trial_step":164,"drawing":1020801},{"step":156,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"你——","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_141"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801165,"trial_step":165,"drawing":1020800},{"step":157,"speaker":"%u","content":"你说，在狄斯你只吃过沙虫，肉很不好吃，你想试试我提过的好吃的东西。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801166,"trial_step":166,"drawing":1020800},{"step":158,"content":"她愣了，而你没有停，看着她的眼睛，缓慢、坚定地继续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801167,"trial_step":167,"drawing":1020800},{"step":159,"speaker":"%u","content":"……你说如果狄斯有庆典、烟花，你也要我带你去看看。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801168,"trial_step":168,"drawing":1020800},{"step":160,"speaker":"%u","content":"还有下雨，下雪，夏天，秋天，冬天。如果我身边还有多好人，你也都想见见，想多交些朋友。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801169,"trial_step":169,"drawing":1020800},{"step":161,"speaker":"%u","content":"你说的每件事，我都记得。你的未来不能被封存，茉莉，约定必须实现，那儿才是你该去的地方。去看看，然后，我会还你自由的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801170,"trial_step":170,"drawing":1020800},{"step":162,"speaker":"%u","content":"……我希望你能真正自由，为此我什么都愿意做。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801171,"trial_step":171,"drawing":1020800},{"step":163,"content":"她看着你，嘴唇微动，想说什么又几次闭紧了嘴。好一阵，才缓缓垂下眼睑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801172,"trial_step":172,"drawing":1020801},{"step":164,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"记这么清干嘛……都是傻话、谎话，实现不了的……","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_149"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801173,"trial_step":173,"drawing":1020801},{"step":165,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"明明忘了就好……","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_150"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801174,"trial_step":174,"drawing":1020801},{"step":166,"options":["……不会忘的，因为你也没忘记"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801175,"trial_step":175,"drawing":1020801},{"step":167,"content":"长发垂落，你看不清她被遮挡的表情。但渐渐地，茉莉绷紧的脊背放松下来，身体恍惚向你靠近了些。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801176,"trial_step":176,"drawing":1020801},{"step":168,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……我知道的，大人都是为我好。谢谢……","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_159"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801177,"trial_step":177,"drawing":1020801},{"step":169,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"我再也不信家乡会没有了。就算电影结束，金猊乡也一定在，总有一天我会回去找它。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_160"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801178,"trial_step":178,"drawing":1020801},{"step":170,"content":"她抬眸，眼中是久违的真诚。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801179,"trial_step":179,"drawing":1020802},{"step":171,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"我听您的话，按约定，留在您身边。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_162"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801180,"trial_step":180,"drawing":1020802},{"step":172,"speaker":"%u","content":"……茉莉……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801181,"trial_step":181,"drawing":1020802},{"step":173,"content":"压在你心上的石头变轻了，你下意识想握住她的手。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801182,"trial_step":182,"drawing":1020802},{"step":174,"content":"——却被她先一步握住了你的，凉意激人。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801183,"trial_step":183,"drawing":1020804},{"step":175,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"但在那之前……我还有一个愿望。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_164"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801184,"trial_step":184,"drawing":1020804},{"step":176,"content":"舞女离了座椅，倾倒腰肢，握着你的手甜甜将你带向她，她的眼神变了，滑腻狡黠，声音软软攀上来，拥住你。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801185,"trial_step":185},{"step":177,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"我想见一些人，无数次出现在我梦里的人……<color=#fb9259>残锋团</color>，对吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_166"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801186,"trial_step":186},{"step":178,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"我知道那是您的朋友，也知道您能找到他们。大人，带我去见见吧。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_167"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801187,"trial_step":187},{"step":179,"content":"你的身体瞬间僵硬。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801188,"trial_step":188},{"step":180,"content":"【回忆】","style":18,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801189,"trial_step":189},{"step":181,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"奥古斯特将军在9月中就带残锋团大部队离开白砂海，归程未定。涅槃港目前由那位戴铁面的副官留守，好消息是，他没有拒绝您的请求：","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_170"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801190,"trial_step":190},{"step":182,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"残锋团已将最新的戾刃限制技术共享给MBCC。正因如此，我们才能安全地将茉莉和她的危险刀刃分离开，这能有效控制她承受的狂厄影响。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_171"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801191,"trial_step":191},{"step":183,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"真让人意外……那本是残锋团的核心技术机密，他们甚至几次拒绝了环研院的请求，现在却同意分享给我们……局长，您是怎么说服他们的？","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_172"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801192,"trial_step":192},{"step":184,"content":"【审查室】","style":18,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801193,"trial_step":193},{"step":185,"content":"茉莉倚靠在你肩头，手向下，轻轻按在你心口处，眯了眼。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801194,"trial_step":194},{"step":186,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"我知道您怕什么，我保证不伤他们，他们可是您的朋友呀！大人是这么好的人，您的朋友一定也很棒。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_175"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801195,"trial_step":195},{"step":187,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"您不是说过，要让我走出来，认识更多好人吗？就他们吧。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_176"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801196,"trial_step":196},{"step":188,"content":"一下，一下，她眯着眼听着你的心跳，熟悉的笑容逐渐浮现。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801197,"trial_step":197},{"step":189,"content":"【闪回】","style":18,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801198,"trial_step":198},{"step":190,"speaker":"铁面","content":"是那个异邦女人……我记得她。万国会，闭幕式，奥古斯特混进FAC指挥车队，连现场安保都没发现，那异邦人却精准找到了她。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_180"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2453,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801199,"trial_step":199},{"step":191,"speaker":"铁面","content":"执念够深的。明明没有任何胜算，却跟疯狗似的死咬着不放，还敢拿我们的刀……呵呵，确实跟戾刃很配，侵蚀到这种地步还不如别醒，可悲的家伙。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_181"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2453,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801200,"trial_step":200},{"step":192,"speaker":"铁面","content":"那就试试治好她吧，局长。治好她，拴牢点，别再让她干之前的蠢事。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_182"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2453,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801201,"trial_step":201},{"step":193,"content":"【审查室】","style":18,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801202,"trial_step":202},{"step":194,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"带我去吧，茉莉一定乖乖的，什么坏事都不会做。我相信他们，就像相信您一样。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_184"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801203,"trial_step":203},{"step":195,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"大人……茉莉只有这一个愿望，求您了。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_185"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801204,"trial_step":204},{"step":196,"content":"她眨着小鹿般晶莹的眼睛，笑容甜似融化的糖霜，满满全是对你的依赖和信任，是你熟悉的笑容。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801205,"trial_step":205},{"step":197,"content":"——万国会的前夜，她就是这么对你笑的，满怀着恨与痛，她也还是会这么笑，这错乱不合时宜的笑容像墓志铭般永远刻在她脸上。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801206,"trial_step":206},{"step":198,"content":"你知道她又在骗你。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801207,"trial_step":207},{"step":199,"content":"但这双破碎的手一松开就会滑向虚无，你只能紧紧握住。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801208,"trial_step":208},{"step":200,"options":["……我答应你"],"style":6,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801209,"trial_step":209,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……我答应你","goto":210}]},{"step":201,"speaker":"%u","content":"残锋团在外执行任务，暂时联系不上。等他们回来，我带你去见他。","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801210,"trial_step":210},{"step":202,"speaker":"%u","content":"在那之前，你要接受治疗，陪我履行约定，好吗？","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801211,"trial_step":211},{"step":203,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"真的？！大人最好了，约好了哦！不能反悔哦～","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_196"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801212,"trial_step":212},{"step":204,"options":["嗯，约好了"],"style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801213,"trial_step":213,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"嗯，约好了","goto":214}]},{"step":205,"content":"你也戴上了虚假的面具。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801214,"trial_step":214},{"step":206,"speaker":"%u","content":"我们都遵守约定。","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801215,"trial_step":215},{"step":207,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"谢谢，谢谢您，大人……","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_200"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801216,"trial_step":216},{"step":208,"content":"她将头轻轻靠在你的胸膛前，露出幸福满足的笑容，听你沉重的心声。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801217,"trial_step":217},{"step":209,"content":"【闪回】","style":18,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801218,"trial_step":218},{"step":210,"speaker":"医生","content":"茉莉的过去太沉重了，背负她比您想象的更加困难……您迟早会后悔的。","voice":["vo_trial_20801_1_203"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801219,"trial_step":219},{"step":211,"content":"【黑屏】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801220,"trial_step":220},{"step":212,"content":"<i>你的确在做蠢事，但……你不能放手。</i>","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120801221,"trial_step":221}]}